# proto-file: flatsat/hardware/devices.proto
# proto-message: flatsat.v1.MagnetorquerDevice
#
# Magnetorquer device specification — the ONE envelope a rod has is its
# dipole moment. There is deliberately NO max torque field: torque is
# m x B, decided by the field where the vehicle is, so writing a torque
# here would grant authority that does not exist and flatter detumble
# (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, "A magnetorquer has no maximum torque").
# Value is placeholder (a 6U-class rod) until a physical part exists.

name: "mtq0"
max_dipole_a_m2: 1.2
